The baseline is vendored from sgl-amd-mono (https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-amd-mono) at 52486703
and from ROCm/aiter (https://github.com/ROCm/aiter) at dbd8bf5bd, with the modifications listed in the
task's task.yaml (baseline.provenance) and in each file's header. walk_plan.py, tail_fill.py and kernel.py were
written for AgentKernelArena (walk_plan.py ports sgl-amd-mono's Triton walk planner to FlyDSL).

